{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40103,"sections":[{"id":"script-20103","name":"原始脚本 20103","scripts":[20103],"start":0,"count":15}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:0","scriptId":20103,"text":"周围的战车兽被一扫而空，连掩体都被炸得分崩离析。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":673,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:1","scriptId":20103,"text":"“会不会做得有些过火了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:2","scriptId":20103,"text":"“怎么会，这里是模拟世界，摧毁的东西只不过是一堆数据而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":673,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:3","scriptId":20103,"text":"“没错，只不过是数据，不用担心啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:4","scriptId":20103,"text":"话语间，波西娅博士已经神不知鬼不觉地出现了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":676,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:5","scriptId":20103,"text":"“哦哦，这不是波西娅博士吗？刚才去哪儿了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":676,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:6","scriptId":20103,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":676,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":29,"speaker":"莫夏·梅列茨安娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:7","scriptId":20103,"text":"“刚刚波西娅博士已经解释过了，只不过你在睡觉……我们现在在模拟世界啦！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":8,"right":29,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":670,"speaker":"多萝·雷德尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:8","scriptId":20103,"text":"“哦哦～虽然没听懂，不过好像很厉害的样子～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":670,"right":29,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":644,"speaker":"玛鲁夏·德米特里耶夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:9","scriptId":20103,"text":"“那么，博士，突然出现在是有什么事情要说吗？还是说任务已经完成了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":670,"right":644,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:10","scriptId":20103,"text":"“哪里，会有这么好的事情，现在开始我要把你们传送到下一个作战地点～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":644,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:11","scriptId":20103,"text":"“传送？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:12","scriptId":20103,"text":"“恩～第一次的话就是会有点头晕～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:13","scriptId":20103,"text":"波西娅好像并没有要继续详细解释的意思，她笑着打了个响指。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20103:20103:14","scriptId":20103,"text":"随后众人的眼前突然一黑，就像谁突然把灯给关了一样……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
